      "speaker_id": "dm-brahma",
      "tail_max_length": 60,
      "text": "You are the sacred utterance by which offerings are made. You are the power by which creation arises, by which it is preserved, and by which it is drawn again into dissolution. You are knowledge, and you are the great illusion that can veil knowledge. You are nature, nourishment and peace. You are also power armed against danger."
